{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google日前披露一起波及Android TV生態的大規模安全事件。一家獲得官方認證的Android TV設備製造商被發現長期在產品中預裝隱藏後門程序，並向第三方出售訪問權限用於分發惡意軟件。在調查完成後，Google宣佈與涉事企業徹底切斷合作關係，並採取法律行動關閉相關惡意網絡基礎設施。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584864.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.526834+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:16:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_hash":"063447013d8c419d400b77f11f25f7b7e9ba26d0c63a29fdcf7b889908e5f6b8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}